OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Jackdaw gas field
OL,4,Aset to be approved in weeks, sources
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe gas field was approved by the
OL,8,Fformer Conservative government in 2022
OL,9,Fbut was delayed by a legal ruling from
OL,10,Fa Scottish court, after environmental
OL,11,Fgroups argued consent was given without
OL,12,Ffully considering the climate impact.
OL,14,FJackdaw's owner says it will account
OL,15,Ffor 6% of UK gas output when at peak
OL,16,Fproduction but environmental groups say
OL,17,Fit will provide only 2% of UK use when
OL,18,Fimports are included.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
